  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (Fire statement, Bedfont lakes proposed floodlighting impact study, 003, 004, HLS4221, Thistle padel club monthly comparison, Panning, design and access statement, Transport statement, unnumbered location plan\r\nReceived: 12/12/2022) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The courts and flood lighting hereby permitted shall not be in use outside the following times: 07:00am to 10:00pm Mondays to Saturdays and 08:00am to 10:00pm on Sundays, public and bank holidays.",
    "Condition : 4 - The lighting levels anywhere on the site shall not exceed any level as set out in the ILP Guidance Note 1 for the reduction of obtrusive light 2021.",
    "Condition : 5 - Notwithstanding the details on the approved plans, prior to commencement of the development hereby approved full details (including manufacturers specifications) of cycle parking facilities (for not less than 2 bicycles) for the users of the development shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. \r\nThe approved facilities shall be fully implemented prior to commencement and thereafter retained for use at all times without obstruction. \r\n"
  ],
